-- 3108 Jakolof Bay Rd ------------------------------------------------------
update public.listings set
  price='$219,900', beds='1', baths='1', sqft='768', status='For Sale', listed_on='2026-07-04',
  description=$d$A charming cabin overlooking the Barabara Creek area with views of Kachemak Bay and the Homer Spit. This cozy, open-style cabin has a new kitchen with living area and bathroom downstairs and a loft bedroom upstairs. Three acres to call your own, an insulated outbuilding for workshop/bunkhouse/storage, a heated 448 sq ft shop/garage, a water catchment system, and an outhouse with a view.

Perched above the Barbara Creek area with sweeping views across Kachemak Bay to the Homer Spit and the twinkling lights of Homer, this inviting cabin instantly feels like home. Freshly painted and lovingly updated, the open-concept cabin is warm and bright. The main level features a sunny new kitchen, cozy living area, and bathroom, while the loft above provides a peaceful sleeping space. The hearth is framed with handsome Italian tile, and a brand-new Toyo stove keeps you warm through every season. Even the never-used composting toilet is ready for its first owner.

Outside, recent tree clearing has opened the property to more sunshine while enhancing the views. Set on three private acres, there's plenty of room to enjoy the outdoors, garden, or simply soak in the peace and quiet. The 448 sq ft heated shop and garage offers excellent space for projects, vehicles, or gear, and an additional insulated outbuilding is wired and ready to become a workshop, bunkhouse, studio, or storage. The cabin is served by a water catchment system with the tank tucked beneath the home. As a bonus, more than four cords of firewood have already been cut, split, and stacked.

Highlights: Bay view · Private yard · Fireplace · Bluff on lot · Wood countertops · Shed.

Home details: Single Family (cabin) · Built 2000 · 3.03-acre lot (bluff, level, private yard) · Not zoned · 1-car garage · Wood-frame, metal roof · Sewer not available.

Schools: Susan B. English Elementary & Middle School · Susan B. English High School.$d$
